# Kabbalah adventure: rounded-hut
# Roy standard hut; editable twelve-sided shell with a small doorway and no decorative streaks; base at origin.
# Actual runtime triangles; +Y up; metres; no image planes or textures.
# Base inks are semantic materials. The game maps them to its discrete lighting palette.
